' BEGIN GENERATED CHESS PIECE-SQUARE TABLES
' Exact compact representation of all twelve piece-square tables. Pawns keep
' rank-sensitive tables; symmetric pieces use their seven possible center
' values. Middle-game rook seventh-rank scoring is handled by the evaluator.
